{
  "repo": "HYDRA-UMC-DETECTION-HEF",
  "ecosystem": "hydra",
  "tagline": "A registry of compiled Hailo models, and a gate that refuses a model that does not match.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-DETECTION-HEF keeps the registry of compiled .hef models: a name, a version, a task, an input shape, the classes and a SHA-256, validated against a schema. A load gate checks the checksum of the file and the Hailo architecture before a model may be loaded. The toolchain that compiles a model (ONNX export, the Hailo Dataflow Compiler, quantisation) is not part of this repository and needs the Hailo SDK on the CM5.",
